---
import Layout from '@estate/ui/PortfolioLayout.astro';import {nav} from '../../data/nav';import '../../styles/global.css';const p=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Sell | ATELIER Estates — Seller Guide" description="A transparent sample property selling process without fabricated transaction claims." brand="ATELIER / ESTATES" nav={nav(p)} accent="#242423"><section class="page-heading container"><p class="eyebrow">SELLING / STRATEGY FIRST</p><h1>A considered<br>way to sell<span class="period">.</span></h1><p>Good preparation gives a property its best chance to stand out. This is an illustrative selling workflow.</p></section><section class="container editorial-guide"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR PROPOSED APPROACH</p><h2>Every property has a story.</h2></div><ol><li><h3>Understand the property</h3><p>Review condition, ownership details, comparable listings and the desired selling timeline.</p></li><li><h3>Present with intention</h3><p>Prepare professional photography, clear specifications, floor plans and an accurate description.</p></li><li><h3>Manage the conversation</h3><p>Qualify enquiries, coordinate viewings and maintain transparent seller communication.</p></li></ol></section><section class="container guide-cta"><h2>Have a property in mind?</h2><a class="solid-button" href={`${p}contact/#enquire`}>Start a sample enquiry ↗</a></section></Layout>
